n ‌squares, and calls for tackling a ⁠mounting housing crisis. FRANCE 24's Sarah Morris reports from Madrid.</summary></entry><entry><title>Evicted pensioner Maricarmen Abascal, heart of Spain's housing protests, dies</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:7a4a204fc8105754fe7c4d4161a0c79be5d49932614c2fbd4f4c472a616b219e</id><updated>2026-10-10T14:32:16Z</updated><published>2026-10-07T19:19:07Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/europe/20261007-evicted-pensioner-maricarmen-abascal-heart-of-spain-housing-protests-has-died--aad131e25ae3.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/europe/20261007-evicted-pensioner-maricarmen-abascal-heart-of-spain-housing-protests-has-died" /><summary type="html">Maricarmen ​Abascal, the 87-year-old woman whose eviction sparked housing ​protests in Spain, has died, Madrid's tenants' union said on Wednesday. Massive protests following Abascal's eviction spiralled into a political crisis, eventually leading Prime Minister Pedro Sanchez to call a snap election.</summary><category term="Europe" /></entry><entry><title>What we know about espionage, treason allegations against Germany's ex-spy chief</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:3ee42bfea320a34750f34e48c29b5a18d4e019ae52402714d7f2f71ba0969755</id><updated>2026-10-10T14:32:16Z</updated><published>2026-10-07T14:06:59Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/europe/20261007-what-we-know-about-espionage-treason-allegations-against-germany-s-ex-spy-chief--62458e57ed6f.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/europe/20261007-what-we-know-about-espionage-treason-allegations-against-germany-s-ex-spy-chief" /><summary type="html">A court on Wednesday ordered the former head of Germany's foreign intelligence service August Hanning to remain in pretrial detention after his arrest on suspicion of espionage and treason, along with a former deputy who allegedly supplied him with secret files. Here's what we know about one of the biggest security breaches in German history.</summary><category term="Europe" /></entry><entry><title>Russia warns against spreading 'false information' as reports emerge of second plague case</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:8311cf194c16486a14f74a053e5e9c5a98e97a6cf03cf436fc5aefa36ec91577</id><updated>2026-10-10T14:32:16Z</updated><published>2026-10-07T13:43:19Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/europe/20261007-russia-warns-against-spreading-false-information-reports-emerge-second-plague-case--88e142bb04b9.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/europe/20261007-russia-warns-against-spreading-false-information-reports-emerge-second-plague-case" /><summary type="html">The World Health Organization joined Western leaders on Wednesday in urging Russia to share more information about what killed a plague institute worker in Siberia as reports emerged of a second suspected case. The Kremlin said Moscow had shared what it knew and accused the media ​of spreading "false information".</summary><category term="Europe" /></entry><entry><title>Nobel Prize in Chemistry awarded to France's Henri Kagan, Japan's Kenso Soai</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:7e1441d353a9d7135d4425cdd160456b0b00c751104b12badf8152f439691383</id><updated>2026-10-10T14:32:16Z</updated><published>2026-10-07T09:52:52Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/europe/20261007-nobel-prize-in-chemistry-jointly-awarded-to-france-s-henri-kagan-japan-s-kenso-soai--fa8fe9233912.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/europe/20261007-nobel-prize-in-chemistry-jointly-awarded-to-france-s-henri-kagan-japan-s-kenso-soai" /><summary type="html">Henri Kagan and Kenso Soai were jointly awarded the Nobel Prize in Chemistry for solving a 100-year-old chemical mystery, the Royal Swedish Academy of Sciences said on Wednesday. Nobel Prize recipients receive a prize of 12 million Swedish kronor (about $1.2 million).</summary><category term="Europe" /></entry></feed>
